{"unit_id": "kyan001__DSH-Jev-Thinking#feature-1", "repo": "kyan001/DSH-Jev-Thinking", "commit": "1f015ec76586a40c5bb1a3217b1e1e70a0da9ad3", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-jev-thinking 的功能「按路由选择推理档位」：读取当前模型路由提供的 reasoning effort 选项，由 Jev 选择其中一档，并将有效结果写入模型请求。每条用户提示最多判断一次。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:129-173", "index.js:272-287"]}
{"unit_id": "kyan001__DSH-Jev-Thinking#feature-2", "repo": "kyan001/DSH-Jev-Thinking", "commit": "1f015ec76586a40c5bb1a3217b1e1e70a0da9ad3", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-jev-thinking 的功能「结合上下文判断短回复」：当用户回复简短确认时，将最近一条助手消息与用户回复一起作为判断输入，帮助按获批任务的实际复杂度选择推理档位。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:122-127", "index.js:192-196", "index.js:237-251"]}
{"unit_id": "kyan001__DSH-Jev-Thinking#feature-3", "repo": "kyan001/DSH-Jev-Thinking", "commit": "1f015ec76586a40c5bb1a3217b1e1e70a0da9ad3", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-jev-thinking 的功能「判断失败时回退」：API 调用超时、返回错误、缺少密钥或输出无效档位时，插件先尝试设置的失败档位，再尝试路由默认档位；没有可用回退值则保留原请求。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:202-212", "index.js:254-265", "index.js:289-294"]}
{"unit_id": "kyan001__DSH-Jev-Thinking#caveat-1", "repo": "kyan001/DSH-Jev-Thinking", "commit": "1f015ec76586a40c5bb1a3217b1e1e70a0da9ad3", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-jev-thinking 使用前须知：提示内容以及可用时最近一条助手消息会发送到 api.typesafe.ai，以判断推理档位。请求需要 TypeSafe API Key；代码将选择结果限定在当前路由提供的档位内。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:215-251", "index.js:307-317"]}
